  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là tâm của hình bình hành <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> cùng hướng và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇔</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/97f4a3c9d58aadd7a9cb014ad38a7c8e1804f63ac3a71aab54a52497de9208dc.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
